earing tactical gear. She should be severely hurt. She should be crudely tied up. Maybe use her ump45 as a prop for tying her up, like a stick. She should have a rope around her neck and get fucked from below or behind, so she can only breathe whenever she gets pushed up. Keep the guy transparent.\n\nWork 2:\nThis should show Runa a while later. She has been left behind, tied up, crying, bleeding and leaking cum. Her clothes are torn and a bomb has been attached to her. Similar to this:\n\nhttps://1drv.ms/i/c/096dde3fcb833b7b/EZjtUUSG1-5EtDRHR_C7sD4BubYR1hxjtN8HokBCtXrFOg?e=Pg7qca", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nyo551/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3711ef0b/uploads/origins/0e122124-ce0e-41ff-8582-936b036f5358?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2f94a456a681153a9540bbce7c57da4d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3711ef0b/uploads/origins/0e122124-ce0e-41ff-8582-936b036f5358?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2f94a456a681153a9540bbce7c57da4d, https://si.imgix.net/3711ef0b/uploads/origins/0e122124-ce0e-41ff-8582-936b036f5358?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=87ffdf166223431f9e7891c881e501d4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3711ef0b/uploads/origins/0e122124-ce0e-41ff-8582-936b036f5358?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1ba149f58c880b175134b49038111d9e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nyo551/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net